			"Message": "build(Worker): Minify ESBuild configuration files\n\nCompress Configuration/ESBuild/Target.js and Worker.js from readable source to minified output. Replaces descriptive variable names (On, Clean, Worker_default, posix, sep) with single letters (e, r, n, a, i), removes all whitespace and comments, and condenses the code into single-line format.\n\nThese configuration files are ESBuild build definitions for the Worker element's compilation pipeline.",
